// vue-adapter
export function useSignalRef<T>(src: { get(): T; peek(): T }) {
/* map to Vue ref, cleanup via onUnmounted */
}
export function useComputedRef<T>(fn: () => T, equals = Object.is) {
/* create computed within lifecycle and convert to ref */
}
Important notes:
- The callback of
useComputedRef
must readsignal.get()
, notref.value
, otherwise it becomes a pure Vue computation and loses your reactive graph. - The bridge only synchronizes values to Vue refs, and does not reconnect Vue's reactivity back into your graph, avoiding circular scheduling dependencies.
- Cleanup uses
onUnmounted
, so unmounting releases the associatedcreateEffect
orcomputed
.

